                <pb facs="0622" n="1356" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1356"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-11-27"><hi rendition="#italic">November 27,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Missionary school of science at Marash burned 19th and telegram delayed.
                    Missionaries safe; protection furnished eight hours after burning. Aintab
                    College protected. JBarnum telegraphs buildings at Harpoot were set on fire
                    separately by Koords and citizens, in presence of soldiers, in Armenian rioting.
                    Houses of Allen, Browne, Wheeler, ladies’ house, chapel, boarding house, girls’
                    theological school, seminary building, worth $44,000, burned; personal property,
                    $33,000; stock and apparatus, $11,000. One hundred soldiers now protect
                    remaining premises. Efficient protection demanded by me and promised seven times
                    since February last. Have telegraphed to Marash for values destroyed. Am now
                    verifying value of Harpoot houses from Bible House reports. Any further
                    investigation would only be a farce, for rioters would outswear missionaries. No
                    concert of the Powers in rational action to enforce order. It is probable that
                    my demand for payment will be met with evasion and delay.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
